 "description": "<div><p>This data shows the approximate locations of on-street parking for motorcycles.  </p></div> <h3>Data currency</h3><div><p>This data in City systems is updated in the normal course of business, however priorities and resources determine how fast a change in reality is reflected in the database.  The extract on this web site is updated weekly.  </p></div> <h3>Data accuracy</h3><div><p>The locations shown are approximate; some icons may show as being in a parcel but the actual location of the motorcycle parking is on the street.</p></div> ",
